{
  "matches": [
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n1",
        "action:n2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To begin the process, start with Password Verification, followed by Verifiy Password."
      ],
      "justification": "The opening clause implicitly starts the process, describes the initial verification step, and the subsequent verification action. Minor source typo ('Verifiy') does not change meaning."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If you choose \"Select Cancel\", you will be directed to iforgot.apple.com. However, if you select \"Reset password\", you will be automatically directed to iforgot.apple.com. In case you choose \"Retry\", you will need to re-enter your password."
      ],
      "justification": "The three conditional clauses collectively establish the user choice point and justify the XOR branch node."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n4",
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "you will be directed to iforgot.apple.com."
      ],
      "justification": "Matches the navigation outcome for the 'Select Cancel' condition."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n5",
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "you will be automatically directed to iforgot.apple.com."
      ],
      "justification": "Matches the automatic navigation outcome for the 'Reset password' condition."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n6",
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "you will need to re-enter your password."
      ],
      "justification": "Matches the required action for the 'Retry' condition."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After that, go to iforgot.apple.com and proceed with Reset Password."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly maps to the post-retry navigation and reset step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once you are automatically directed to iforgot.apple.com, proceed with Reset Password."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly maps to the post-auto-direction reset step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "and then verify it."
      ],
      "justification": "Extracts the verification instruction following the re-entry instruction, preserving ordering."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10",
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the password is reset, you can return to the iTunes purchases page."
      ],
      "justification": "The conditional paths implicitly rejoin (converges) before the stated completion. The merge action models this rejoining redundantly but faithfully, leading directly to the iTunes return step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "From there, select the price of the item."
      ],
      "justification": "Exact match for the price selection step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If prompted to \"Enter Password\", verify the password. Alternatively, if asked to \"Enter Apple ID\", enter the password."
      ],
      "justification": "The two alternative prompt scenarios establish the second decision point and justify the XOR branch."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n14",
        "action:n14"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "verify the password."
      ],
      "justification": "Matches the verification action triggered by the 'Enter Password' prompt."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n15",
        "action:n15"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "enter the password."
      ],
      "justification": "Matches the entry action triggered by the 'Enter Apple ID' prompt."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n16",
        "action:n17"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Finally, enter the password and verify it."
      ],
      "justification": "Covers the final verification step, the modeled terminal action, and the implicit process conclusion."
    }
